@startuml
[*] --> Idle

Idle --> ImageUpload : Upload Images
ImageUpload --> Idle : Cancel Upload
ImageUpload --> ImageProcessing : Process Images
ImageProcessing --> KeywordDetection : Keywords Found
ImageProcessing --> OutputGeneration : No Keywords
ImageProcessing --> ErrorHandling : Processing Failed
KeywordDetection --> OutputGeneration : No Keywords
KeywordDetection --> KeywordExtraction : Keywords Found
KeywordExtraction --> OutputGeneration : Extracted
OutputGeneration --> [*] : Done
ErrorHandling --> [*] : Error Resolved

Idle : System is idle
ImageUpload : Uploading images
ImageProcessing : Converting images to text
KeywordDetection : Detecting keywords
KeywordExtraction : Extracting relevant information
OutputGeneration : Generating output
ErrorHandling : Handling errors
@enduml
